bigraph(MixedGraph) -- extract the bigraph component of a mixed graph
*********************************************************************

  * Function: *note bigraph: bigraph,
  * Usage: 
        B=bigraph G
  * Inputs:
      * G, an instance of the type *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph,, 
  * *note Optional inputs: (Macaulay2Doc)using functions with optional inputs,:
      * *note EntryMode: bigraph_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmEntryMode=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, => ...,
        default value "auto", optional input, accepts 'auto', 'edges', or
        'neighbors'
      * *note Singletons: bigraph_lp_pd_pd_pd_cmSingletons=>_pd_pd_pd_rp, =>
        ..., default value null, optional input, accepts the list of isolated
        vertices in a bigraph
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note Bigraph: Bigraph,, 

Description
===========

This method extracts the largest component of class *note Bigraph: Bigraph, of
a mixed graph.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G= mixedGraph(graph{{a,b},{b,c}},digraph {{a,d},{c,e},{f,g}},bigraph    |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{d => {e}}}                                |
|                                   e => {d}                                  |
|                Digraph => Digraph{a => {d}}                                 |
|                                   c => {e}                                  |
|                                   d => {}                                   |
|                                   e => {}                                   |
|                                   f => {g}                                  |
|                                   g => {}                                   |
|                Graph => Graph{a => {b}   }                                  |
|                               b => {a, c}                                   |
|                               c => {b}                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : MixedGraph                                                              |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|{{d,e}})                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : bigraph G                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = Bigraph{d => {e}}                                                       |
|             e => {d}                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Bigraph                                                                 |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

