collateVertices -- convert a mixed graph into a new mixed graph where each component subgraph has the same set of vertices
**************************************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        collateVertices(G)
  * Inputs:
      * G, an instance of the type *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph,, 

Description
===========

Let G=mixedGraph(U,D,B) and denote the vertices of U by V1, the vertices of D
by V2 and the vertices of B by  V3. Then the method collateVertices(G) outputs
a mixedGraph with same edges as before but with V1 \cup V2 \cup V3 as the
vertices of U,D and B.



+-----------------------------------------------+
|i1 : U = graph{{1,2},{2,3},{3,4},{1,4},{1,5}}  |
|                                               |
|o1 = Graph{1 => {2, 4, 5}}                     |
|           2 => {1, 3}                         |
|           3 => {2, 4}                         |
|           4 => {1, 3}                         |
|           5 => {1}                            |
|                                               |
|o1 : Graph                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i2 : D = digraph{{2,1},{3,1},{7,8}}            |
|                                               |
|o2 = Digraph{1 => {} }                         |
|             2 => {1}                          |
|             3 => {1}                          |
|             7 => {8}                          |
|             8 => {}                           |
|                                               |
|o2 : Digraph                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i3 : B = bigraph{{1,5}}                        |
|                                               |
|o3 = Bigraph{1 => {5}}                         |
|             5 => {1}                          |
|                                               |
|o3 : Bigraph                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i4 : G = mixedGraph(U,D,B)                     |
|                                               |
|o4 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{1 => {5}}  }|
|                                   5 => {1}    |
|                Digraph => Digraph{1 => {} }   |
|                                   2 => {1}    |
|                                   3 => {1}    |
|                                   7 => {8}    |
|                                   8 => {}     |
|                Graph => Graph{1 => {2, 4, 5}} |
|                               2 => {1, 3}     |
|                               3 => {2, 4}     |
|                               4 => {1, 3}     |
|                               5 => {1}        |
|                                               |
|o4 : MixedGraph                                |
+-----------------------------------------------+
|i5 : collateVertices G                         |
|                                               |
|o5 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{1 => {5}}  }|
|                                   2 => {}     |
|                                   3 => {}     |
|                                   4 => {}     |
|                                   5 => {1}    |
|                                   7 => {}     |
|                                   8 => {}     |
|                Digraph => Digraph{1 => {} }   |
|                                   2 => {1}    |
|                                   3 => {1}    |
|                                   4 => {}     |
|                                   5 => {}     |
|                                   7 => {8}    |
|                                   8 => {}     |
|                Graph => Graph{1 => {2, 4, 5}} |
|                               2 => {1, 3}     |
|                               3 => {2, 4}     |
|                               4 => {1, 3}     |
|                               5 => {1}        |
|                               7 => {}         |
|                               8 => {}         |
|                                               |
|o5 : MixedGraph                                |
+-----------------------------------------------+

Ways to use collateVertices:
============================

  * "collateVertices(MixedGraph)"

For the programmer
==================

The object *note collateVertices: collateVertices, is a *note method function:
(Macaulay2Doc)MethodFunction,.

