descendants(MixedGraph,Thing) -- return the descendants of a vertex of a mixed graph
************************************************************************************

  * Function: *note descendants: (Graphs)descendants,
  * Usage: 
        descendents (G,v)
        descendants (G,v)
  * Inputs:
      * G, an instance of the type *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph,, 
      * v, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, a vertex of G 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note set: (Macaulay2Doc)Set,, 

Description
===========

The descendants of v are the all the vertices u such that u is reachable from v
in the directed edge set of the *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph, G. Another way to
more intuitively see what the descendants are is to see the descendants of a
vertex v can be found by first taking the children of v. Then if you take the
children of each of the children, and continue the process until the list stops
growing, this will form all the descendants of v.

The output also includes the vertex v from the input in the set of the
descendants.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = mixedGraph(graph{{3,1}},digraph {{1,2},{2,3}},bigraph {{3,4},{2,4}})|
|                                                                             |
|o1 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{2 => {4}   }}                             |
|                                   3 => {4}                                  |
|                                   4 => {3, 2}                               |
|                Digraph => Digraph{1 => {2}}                                 |
|                                   2 => {3}                                  |
|                                   3 => {}                                   |
|                Graph => Graph{1 => {3}}                                     |
|                               3 => {1}                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : MixedGraph                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : descendants (G,1)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = set {1, 2, 3}                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : descendants (G,2)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = set {2, 3}                                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : descendants (G,3)                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = set {3}                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : Set                                                                     |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph, -- a graph that has undirected, directed and
    bidirected edges
  * *note descendants: (Graphs)descendants, -- returns the descendants of a
    digraph
  * *note forefathers: (Graphs)forefathers, -- returns the forefathers of a
    digraph
  * *note forefathers(MixedGraph,Thing): forefathers_lpMixedGraph_cmThing_rp,
    -- return the forefathers of a vertex of a mixed graph
  * *note nondescendants: (Graphs)nondescendants, -- returns the nondescendants
    of a vertex of a digraph
  * *note nondescendants(MixedGraph,Thing):
    nondescendants_lpMixedGraph_cmThing_rp, -- return the nondescendents of a
    vertex of a mixed graph

