mixedGraph -- create a mixed graph from a combination of undirected graph, digraph and bigraph
**********************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        G= mixedGraph(U, D, B)
        G= mixedGraph G
        G= mixedGraph D
        G= mixedGraph B
        G= mixedGraph(G, D)
        G= mixedGraph(G, B)
        G= mixedGraph(D, B)
  * Inputs:
      * U, a *note graph: (Graphs)Graph,, component that contains all
        undirected edges of the graph
      * D, a *note digraph: (Graphs)Digraph,, component that contains all
        directed edges of the graph
      * B, an instance of the type *note Bigraph: Bigraph,, component that
        contains all bidirected edges of the graph
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph,, 

Description
===========

This is a constructor of graphs of class *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph, from a
combination of subgraphs of classes *note Graph: (Graphs)Graph,, *note Digraph:
(Graphs)Digraph, and *note Bigraph: Bigraph,.  One can also input any subset
and any permutation of the arguments. Each type of subgraph can appear at most
once.

Note that this constructor does not check the input satisfies the properties of
loopless mixed graphs from Sadeghi and Lauritzen, 2020
<https://arxiv.org/pdf/1109.5909.pdf>.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = mixedGraph(graph{{1,2}},digraph {{1,3},{2,3}},bigraph {{3,4}})|
|                                                                       |
|o1 = MixedGraph{Bigraph => Bigraph{3 => {4}}}                          |
|                                   4 => {3}                            |
|                Digraph => Digraph{1 => {3}}                           |
|                                   2 => {3}                            |
|                                   3 => {}                             |
|                Graph => Graph{1 => {2}}                               |
|                               2 => {1}                                |
|                                                                       |
|o1 : MixedGraph                                                        |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note MixedGraph: MixedGraph, -- a graph that has undirected, directed and
    bidirected edges

